  "editorial_flags": [
    "The project term «Управление охраны Лунмэня» for 近卫局 and «Цензор» for 监察司 remains a working glossary choice; unify against the Russian Arknights Wiki during the literary pass.",
    "The phrase 归属感 at CN line 74 is rendered as «чувство принадлежности»; verify its nuance in the final dialogue edit.",
    "CN line 186 distinguishes 神民 and 先民; Russian uses «Старшие» and «Древние», following the Russian Arknights Wiki terminology.",
    "CN line 190 uses 平视 figuratively; Russian renders equal treatment / equal footing, not a literal physical gaze.",
    "CN line 193 compresses the image of FrostNova's final struggle into one sentence; the draft merits a literary pass.",
    "CN line 279 雷霆手段 is rendered as «беспощадны его методы»; the phrase can also mean forceful or brutal methods.",
    "CN line 271 不送 is a conventional refusal to see the departing guest out; Russian uses «Не стану вас провожать».",
    "CN line 333 诱敌深入 describes luring the enemy deeper into the city; Russian uses «тактика заманивания противника вглубь».",
    "CN lines 352–354 frame an 'Infected side' of Rhodes Island, which Amiya explicitly rejects; Russian preserves this contrast as «направление заражённых».",
    "CN line 406 explicitly says 围棋 (Go), while EN Yostar says chess. Russian follows CN.",
    "CN line 438 uses 陈警司; the draft uses «суперинтендант Чэнь» following EN Yostar. Confirm the police-rank equivalent during literary review.",
    "CN line 464 uses 科西切 for Duke Kashchey; «Кашчей» is a provisional transliteration pending terminology approval.",
    "CN lines 540–560 use 核心城 and 城邦认证码; the draft uses «ядро Чернобога» and «идентификационные коды города». Unify technical terms during the chapter-7 pass.",
    "CN line 490 uses 姓林的; «люди из семьи Линь» follows the EN plural reading, but the exact referent should be confirmed from wider context."
  ],
